; Optional local policy for Fedora 43/44 installations of the FTE3600 driver.
; Fedora labels every /dev/gpiochip* node gpio_device_t, so this necessarily
; permits fprintd_t to perform the listed operations on all GPIO character
; devices. Install only after verifying an AVC denial and the local contexts.
(allow fprintd_t gpio_device_t (chr_file (getattr open read write ioctl)))
